# Xotik performance

## Capability tiers

- Tier 0: static AVIF/WebP + CSS (reduced motion, saveData, WebGL fail)
- Tier 1: parallax / image sequences / Lottie — no full R3F scene
- Tier 2: R3F + GSAP full experience

Use `detectCapabilityTier()` / `useCapabilityTierContext()`. Never block first paint on WebGL.

## Asset budgets (hard)

- Hero still: 120–220 KB
- Mobile GLB: ≤300 KB
- Desktop GLB: ≤450 KB
- Initial page (pre-3D): ≤450 KB
- Total Tier 2 homepage: ≤2.5 MB

## India / mobile

- Test 360 / 390 / 430 breakpoints
- `overflow-x: clip` on html and body
- Lazy-load 3D after hero paint
